OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy again with
OL,6,Fperhaps some haar at times. Further
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy showers through the
OL,8,Fday, merging to longer spells of rain
OL,9,Fat times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay cloudy through
OL,12,Fthe evening and overnight with
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy showers or longer
OL,14,Fspells of rain at times and a few
OL,15,Fpatches of haar.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FHaar and occasionally heavy
OL,18,Frain soon clears east. Then rather
OL,19,Fcloudy with scattered showers and just
OL,20,Fa few brighter interludes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
