OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FChangeable with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells over the
OL,8,Fweekend, scattered showers on Saturday
OL,9,Fbecoming confined to Orkney on Sunday.
OL,10,FLikely turning wet and windy through
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
